<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bankers Trust EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bankers Trust EPS view raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown Brothers Harriman analyst Raphael Soifer said Thursday he raised his 1997 pooled basis earnings view for Bankers Trust New York Corp to $7.25 per share from $7.10.</p>
<p>-- Change in EPS view reflects company announcement Wednesday that merger with Alex. Brown Inc is expected to become effective September 1 rather than in November as originally expected</p>
<p>-- Earlier merger completion will allow Bankers Trust to realize more of anticipated merger benefits sooner.</p>
<p>-- Analyst says 4.0 pct dividend yield &quot;quite safe&quot;</p>
</text>
